---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <article
      class="bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#F8FDFF,#FFFFFF)] text-black rounded-2xl p-4 lg:p-10 border-2 border-main-200"
    >
      <h2 class="text-center">
        <span
          class="bg-linear-to-r from-[#0179B4] to-[#88D8FF] bg-clip-text text-transparent"
          >Why this exists:
        </span> the shortage is real
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-4 lg:gap-10 mt-4 lg:mt-10 items-stretch text-center md:text-left">
        <div>
          <Image
            src="/img/img2.webp"
            alt="Illustrative reference image"
            format="webp"
            quality="low"
            width="448"
            height="344"
            class="w-auto h-auto mx-auto rounded-xl object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="h-full flex flex-col justify-between align-start">
          <p class="mb-5">
            Hospitals in Europe, the United States and the Gulf are short of
            nurses, midwives and paramedics, and the shortage is not closing on
            its own. Meanwhile there are outstanding clinicians in Ghana,
            Nigeria and Kenya whose registration, licence and experience are
            real but whose records are hard to verify from abroad &mdash; so
            good people get filtered out by process, not by ability.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-5">
            MedicSupport Network exists to remove that translation problem. We
            verify against the issuing bodies once, hold the record, and make
            it readable to a hospital in another country. We are a new company
            and we would rather show you the work than invent a number about
            it.
          </p>
          <a
            href="#apply"
            class="btn bg-[linear-gradient(125deg,var(--color-main-100),var(--color-main-200))] text-white border-0 rounded-xl text-lg py-3 px-6 h-auto shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl md:mr-auto"
            >Start your profile</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
